<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net9.0</TargetFramework>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>

    <!-- Package properties -->
    <Authors>ModelingEvolution Team</Authors>
    <Company>ModelingEvolution</Company>
    <Product>ModelingEvolution.PropertyKinds</Product>
    <Copyright>Copyright © 2026 ModelingEvolution</Copyright>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/modelingevolution/property-kinds</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/modelingevolution/property-kinds</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>units;value-type;dimensions;parsing;formatting;search;facets;value-object</PackageTags>
    <Description>A closed catalogue of typed property value kinds — mass, length, current, voltage, frequency, power, duration, angle, speed, percent, 3-D size and numeric ranges — each a readonly record struct with a stable invariant canonical form, tolerant parsing, unit-preserving formatting, and the search operators the kind supports.</Description>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
